    description: "WI-mafik Level 1b child. Aliased named imports in js_ts.py emit calls edges whose callable is the alias, not the underlying name. Repro: `import { writeFile as wf } from \"node:fs/promises\"` + `wf(p, content)` emits dst `typescript:fs/promises:0-0:wf:unresolved`. Expected: dst contains `writeFile`. Fix lives in packages/hypergumbo-lang-mainstream/src/hypergumbo_lang_mainstream/js_ts.py — import-alias resolution at the call-site lookup. Acceptance: remove the xfail_reason for js_ts in packages/hypergumbo-lang-mainstream/tests/test_polyglot_call_site_coverage.py without other test changes."  # bb85
